# A deployed spell's dist/ is committed (seams Contract 4 — the deployed spell
# folder has no surface source, only the pre-built output), so each one is
# un-ignored by hand. mind-mapper's deployed folder sits OUTSIDE the shipped
# plugin, at plugins/unreleased/skills/, until its app is finished — see
# plugins/unreleased/README.md.
